2026-04-04 00:05:15,017 [INFO] sqlalchemy.engine.Engine:1846 - [generated in 0.00077s] ('e83acb7b-c51b-4bed-917d-2a203d8ba7c2', 1, '纨绔十年', '主角穿越十年回顾：从现代社畜到溪国丞相之子，欺男霸女、横行霸道的纨绔生活。展示主角的荒唐与空虚，为后续觉醒做铺垫。')
2026-04-04 00:05:15,050 [INFO] sqlalchemy.engine.Engine:1846 - INSERT INTO chapter_outlines (project_id, chapter_number, title, summary) VALUES (%s, %s, %s, %s)
2026-04-04 00:05:15,050 [INFO] sqlalchemy.engine.Engine:1846 - [cached since 0.03309s ago] ('e83acb7b-c51b-4bed-917d-2a203d8ba7c2', 2, '慕家女子', '主角在街头调戏慕家凡人支系女子，恰好被路过的慕沛灵撞见。慕沛灵出手教训，一招让主角「不举」。主角惊恐之余，意识到这个世界不简单。')
2026-04-04 00:05:15,082 [INFO] sqlalchemy.engine.Engine:1846 - INSERT INTO chapter_outlines (project_id, chapter_number, title, summary) VALUES (%s, %s, %s, %s)
2026-04-04 00:05:15,082 [INFO] sqlalchemy.engine.Engine:1846 - [cached since 0.06721s ago] ('e83acb7b-c51b-4bed-917d-2a203d8ba7c2', 3, '确认世界', '主角根据「慕沛灵」「溪国」「慕家」等关键词，确认这是《凡人修仙传》世界。恐慌之后冷静分析：韩立已经150多岁，自己这辈子注定抢不到机缘。但主角不甘心，决定修仙。')
2026-04-04 00:05:15,118 [INFO] sqlalchemy.engine.Engine:1846 - INSERT INTO chapter_outlines (project_id, chapter_number, title, summary) VALUES (%s, %s, %s, %s)
2026-04-04 00:05:15,118 [INFO] sqlalchemy.engine.Engine:1846 - [cached since 0.09897s ago] ('e83acb7b-c51b-4bed-917d-2a203d8ba7c2', 4, '测灵根', '主角动用丞相府资源，找到落云宗外门执事测灵根。结果：木水双灵根，资质尚可。主角决定拜入落云宗。')
2026-04-04 00:05:15,150 [INFO] sqlalchemy.engine.Engine:1846 - INSERT INTO chapter_outlines (project_id, chapter_number, title, summary) VALUES (%s, %s, %s, %s)
2026-04-04 00:05:15,150 [INFO] sqlalchemy.engine.Engine:1846 - [cached since 0.1299s ago] ('e83acb7b-c51b-4bed-917d-2a203d8ba7c2', 5, '入门考核', '主角参加落云宗入门考核。凭借前世记忆和谨慎性格，通过测试。正式成为落云宗外门弟子。')
2026-04-04 00:05:15,180 [INFO] sqlalchemy.engine.Engine:1846 - INSERT INTO chapter_outlines (project_id, chapter_number, title, summary) VALUES (%s, %s, %s, %s)
2026-04-04 00:05:15,180 [INFO] sqlalchemy.engine.Engine:1846 - [cached since 0.1612s ago] ('e83acb7b-c51b-4bed-917d-2a203d8ba7c2', 6, '宗门初识', '主角了解落云宗的派系分布、资源获取方式。决定苟道发育，不站队、不惹事。结识同门师兄弟，初步建立人际关系网。')
2026-04-04 00:05:15,211 [INFO] sqlalchemy.engine.Engine:1846 - INSERT INTO chapter_outlines (project_id, chapter_number, title, summary) VALUES (%s, %s, %s, %s)
2026-04-04 00:05:15,214 [INFO] sqlalchemy.engine.Engine:1846 - [cached since 0.1936s ago] ('e83acb7b-c51b-4bed-917d-2a203d8ba7c2', 7, '卜卦初现', '主角发现自己有卜卦能力，第一次使用：算今日运势。结果显示「宜静不宜动」。主角听从卦象，躲过一次外门弟子冲突。但使用后轻微头晕——发现卜卦有代价。')
2026-04-04 00:05:15,245 [INFO] sqlalchemy.engine.Engine:1846 - INSERT INTO chapter_outlines (project_id, chapter_number, title, summary) VALUES (%s, %s, %s, %s)
2026-04-04 00:05:15,245 [INFO] sqlalchemy.engine.Engine:1846 - [cached since 0.2264s ago] ('e83acb7b-c51b-4bed-917d-2a203d8ba7c2', 8, '炼气之路', '主角开始修炼炼气期功法。木水双灵根的优势显现：修炼速度尚可，但资源消耗大。主角开始规划如何获取更多灵石和丹药。')
2026-04-04 00:05:15,277 [INFO] sqlalchemy.engine.Engine:1846 - INSERT INTO chapter_outlines (project_id, chapter_number, title, summary) VALUES (%s, %s, %s, %s)
2026-04-04 00:05:15,277 [INFO] sqlalchemy.engine.Engine:1846 - [cached since 0.2587s ago] ('e83acb7b-c51b-4bed-917d-2a203d8ba7c2', 9, '第一次任务', '主角接取宗门任务：采集灵草。凭借卜卦能力避开危险区域，顺利完成任务。获得第一笔贡献点。')
2026-04-04 00:05:15,310 [INFO] sqlalchemy.engine.Engine:1846 - INSERT INTO chapter_outlines (project_id, chapter_number, title, summary) VALUES (%s, %s, %s, %s)
2026-04-04 00:05:15,311 [INFO] sqlalchemy.engine.Engine:1846 - [cached since 0.291s ago] ('e83acb7b-c51b-4bed-917d-2a203d8ba7c2', 10, '卜卦的代价', '主角尝试用卜卦算一个筑基期师兄的底牌，结果反噬吐血。主角意识到：算越强的人，代价越大。决定谨慎使用卜卦。')
2026-04-04 00:05:15,343 [INFO] sqlalchemy.engine.Engine:1846 - INSERT INTO chapter_outlines (project_id, chapter_number, title, summary) VALUES (%s, %s, %s, %s)
