2026-04-04 00:05:15,400 [INFO] sqlalchemy.engine.Engine:1846 - INSERT INTO chapter_outlines (project_id, chapter_number, title, summary) VALUES (%s, %s, %s, %s)
2026-04-04 00:05:15,400 [INFO] sqlalchemy.engine.Engine:1846 - [cached since 0.3883s ago] ('e83acb7b-c51b-4bed-917d-2a203d8ba7c2', 13, '三年之后', '时间跳跃：主角炼气六层。回顾三年来的发育：低调、谨慎、小有积蓄。结识了几个有用的「朋友」。')
